==Description==
The '''Autumn Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 18 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|550 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|166}} ({{Robux|124}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|4,870 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|1,282}} ({{Robux|967}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

The '''Autumn Nametag''' has orange gradient text and a black outline. It has orange waves behind it, with multiple orange leaves falling off the nametag.

